5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the calendar slipping again. We need to see where the time actually goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m curious how much the timetable absorbs while work is running. It feels overlooked.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff carrying the routine upkeep have had no relief for years. That needs checking.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to know which past projects actually landed well for the people using them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The paper figures rarely survive contact with the market. I’d like to see the tender records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, yes, the costs are a mystery. But the schedule is where we lose the most.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, I agree. If the staff are stretched, the rooms won’t be usable anyway.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, exactly. The technicians are logging hours on manual checks that shouldn’t be needed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, the schedule is important, but we need to know if the result was worth it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, fair point. But if the budget is wrong, the project fails before it starts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think we should look at the weather days and the staffing posts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the timetable records and the booking data for the rooms.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I’ll look into the staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll investigate the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll look at the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. Let’s see what the data says.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m excited to see if the rooms are actually being used.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I hope we can find a way to ease the load on the staff.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I want to ensure we don’t repeat past mistakes.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s hope the numbers tell the truth this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
