35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found that six weeks were lost to weather. That’s a huge chunk of the year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, that’s terrible. I found that specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"@Yumi, I see. I found that technicians are doing manual checks because the equipment is failing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, that’s concerning. I found that projects with broad access were rated highest.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, interesting. I found that mechanical costs rose by a fifth, but surfacing costs stayed flat.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, so the weather affects the outdoor work most. We need to plan for that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, yes. And if we build specialist rooms, they might just sit empty.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, if we upgrade the ventilation, the technicians won’t have to do those manual checks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, that makes sense. But we need to make sure the space is accessible to everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, the cost of mechanical work is rising. We need to be careful with that.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I think the Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade is a good idea. It solves a real problem.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree. The booking data shows we need general space, not more specialist rooms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I support the ventilation upgrade. It will help the staff and the students.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I’m leaning towards the Central Study Commons. It fits the post-occupancy findings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The ventilation upgrade is costly, but the cost of inaction is higher. I’ll support it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Let’s vote for the Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I’ll vote for the Central Study Commons.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I’ll vote for the Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll vote for the Central Study Commons.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll vote for the Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
